## Scope / 适用范围

This license covers the source code of the HarmonyOS port (everything in this
repository) **and** the upstream Motrix Turbo source vendored under
`vendor/motrix/` (upstream is MIT-licensed: see `vendor/motrix/LICENSE`).

It does **NOT** automatically cover:

1. **Third-party assets bundled by upstream** — most notably the settings /
   speed-mode glassmorphism icons whose license upstream records as
   `NOASSERTION`. See `vendor/motrix/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for the complete
   and authoritative list. If you redistribute this project you are responsible
   for those assets or must replace them.
2. **Native binaries that the build process downloads / builds and bundles into
   a HAP** (they are not part of this repository):
   - `aria2c` — Motrix fork of aria2, **GPL-2.0-or-later**
     (<https://github.com/motrixapp/aria2>); the full license text is kept at
     `vendor/motrix/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/aria2-COPYING`.
     Distributing a build that bundles this binary means you must also meet
     GPL-2.0's source-offer obligations for that binary.
   - `libnode.so` — Node.js runtime, MIT.
   - `better-sqlite3` native module — MIT.
   - `libc++_shared.so` — LLVM libc++, Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception.
   - `cacert.pem` — Mozilla CA bundle, MPL-2.0.

See `docs/ASSETS.md` and `docs/THIRD-PARTY.md` for details.